{
    "title": "Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play",
    "description": "Craft chaos and experiment with physics in this Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play ragdoll game!\r\n\r\nWelcome to Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play, a craftsman ragdoll 3D physics simulator game where your imagination runs wild and ragdolls become your playthings! Whether you want to experiment with science and magic, create your own machines, or just cause chaos and destruction, this game has it all. You can play with different projectile-based weapons, explosives, electricity, fire, acid, and more. You can also customize your ragdolls with different outfits, accessories, and hairstyles. The game has no limits, no rules, and no objectives. You are free to do whatever you want in this large open playground. \r\n\r\nHuman Sandbox: Ragdoll Play gameplay: \r\n- Pick your ragdoll playthings: Tap on the screen to spawn ragdolls, items, tools, powers, and characters. You can choose from a variety of options, each with unique properties and reactions.\r\n- Drag, drop, rotate, and resize the objects to position them as you like. You can also use the grid and snap tools to align them precisely.\r\n- Unleash your inner inventor: Build intricate contraptions and machines using blocks, tools, and gadgets. \r\n- Get hands-on: Interact with the craftsman ragdolls directly. Toss them around, poke them with sticks, or unleash your arsenal of tools and powers.\r\n- Become a maestro of mayhem: Take experiment on ragdoll in almost every way. The possibilities are as endless as your imagination!\r\n- Build your world: You can create your own sandbox playground with unlimited possibilities. You can experiment with different combinations of objects and environments, and see how the ragdolls behave and interact. You can also make your own stories, challenges, and games. \r\n- Sit back and enjoy the show: Watch how the ragdolls react to the objects and forces you applied. You can also pause, resume, and reset the simulation at any time. \r\n\r\nHuman Sandbox: Ragdoll Play key features: \r\n- Detailed graphics: Pixel art style, with high-quality textures, lighting, and shadows. \r\n- Extensive ragdoll physics: Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play uses a realistic physics engine to simulate the movements, collisions, and deformations of the ragdolls and objects. Watch craftsman ragdolls crumple, twist, and contort in hilariously realistic ways on the playground.\r\n- Vast sandbox of tools and powers: From TNT explosions to shrink rays, the possibilities are endless.\r\n- Sandbox mode: Craft custom scenes and environments to set the stage for your experiments. \r\n\r\nHuman Sandbox: Ragdoll Play is the perfect way to let out your emotions and have a blast. This sandbox game is not for the faint of heart, but for those who enjoy dark humor and twisted fun. The more you play it, the better it truly gets. Download Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play today and enjoy the ultimate ragdoll physics simulator game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Craft chaos and experiment with physics in this Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play ragdoll game!<br><br>Welcome to Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play, a craftsman ragdoll 3D physics simulator game where your imagination runs wild and ragdolls become your playthings! Whether you want to experiment with science and magic, create your own machines, or just cause chaos and destruction, this game has it all. You can play with different projectile-based weapons, explosives, electricity, fire, acid, and more. You can also customize your ragdolls with different outfits, accessories, and hairstyles. The game has no limits, no rules, and no objectives. You are free to do whatever you want in this large open playground. <br><br>Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play gameplay: <br>- Pick your ragdoll playthings: Tap on the screen to spawn ragdolls, items, tools, powers, and characters. You can choose from a variety of options, each with unique properties and reactions.<br>- Drag, drop, rotate, and resize the objects to position them as you like. You can also use the grid and snap tools to align them precisely.<br>- Unleash your inner inventor: Build intricate contraptions and machines using blocks, tools, and gadgets. <br>- Get hands-on: Interact with the craftsman ragdolls directly. Toss them around, poke them with sticks, or unleash your arsenal of tools and powers.<br>- Become a maestro of mayhem: Take experiment on ragdoll in almost every way. The possibilities are as endless as your imagination!<br>- Build your world: You can create your own sandbox playground with unlimited possibilities. You can experiment with different combinations of objects and environments, and see how the ragdolls behave and interact. You can also make your own stories, challenges, and games. <br>- Sit back and enjoy the show: Watch how the ragdolls react to the objects and forces you applied. You can also pause, resume, and reset the simulation at any time. <br><br>Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play key features: <br>- Detailed graphics: Pixel art style, with high-quality textures, lighting, and shadows. <br>- Extensive ragdoll physics: Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play uses a realistic physics engine to simulate the movements, collisions, and deformations of the ragdolls and objects. Watch craftsman ragdolls crumple, twist, and contort in hilariously realistic ways on the playground.<br>- Vast sandbox of tools and powers: From TNT explosions to shrink rays, the possibilities are endless.<br>- Sandbox mode: Craft custom scenes and environments to set the stage for your experiments. <br><br>Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play is the perfect way to let out your emotions and have a blast. This sandbox game is not for the faint of heart, but for those who enjoy dark humor and twisted fun. The more you play it, the better it truly gets. Download Human Sandbox: Ragdoll Play today and enjoy the ultimate ragdoll physics simulator game.",
